@startuml UC-05
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-05.md
title UC-05: Forgot Password
footer Feature AUTH-05 | Business rules: BR-05
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Guest" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "AuthController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "AuthService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
participant "IEmailService" as MAIL <<Daisy.Infrastructure>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Submit email on Forgot Password form
MVC -> API : POST /api/auth/forgot-password { email }
API -> SVC : ForgotPasswordAsync(email)
SVC -> DB : Find user by email
alt email not registered
  SVC --> API : OK (no email sent)
  API --> MVC : 200 OK
  MVC --> U : Show "If the email exists, a reset link has been sent"
else user found
  SVC -> SVC : Generate random token + expiry (BR-05)
  SVC -> DB : Save ResetPasswordToken (hashed) + ResetPasswordExpiresAt\n(replaces previous token)
  SVC -> MAIL : SendPasswordResetAsync(email, resetLink)
  alt email sent
    MAIL --> SVC : OK
    SVC --> API : OK
    API --> MVC : 200 OK
    MVC --> U : Show "If the email exists, a reset link has been sent"
  else sending failed
    MAIL --> SVC : Error (logged)
    SVC --> API : ServiceUnavailableException
    API --> MVC : 503 Service Unavailable
    MVC --> U : Show "Please try again later"
  end
end

@enduml
